    "paragraph": "Five address-matching methods were evaluated to assign Unique Property Reference Numbers to Early Years Provider records from England's 2017 Ofsted register. A prospective cohort study of 98,560 women in Nepal measured the risk of pre-eclampsia following high ambient temperature exposure over a seven-day lag period. Additionally, remote-sensing data from 2000 to 2020 was used to examine the spatiotemporal interaction between built-up area growth and carbon stocks across China's Chengdu-Chongqing urban agglomeration.",
